===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|covent}}, from {{der|en|xno|covent|covent, cuvent}}, from {{der|en|fro|covent}}, from {{der|en|la|conventum}}, from {{m|la|conveniō}}, from {{m|la|cum||with}} and {{m|la|venio||I come}}. {{doublet|en|convent}}.

